Trellis Pi web search extension (core-rules/pi/web-search)

This extension adapts request/grounding design from two MIT-licensed sources.
No source file was copied verbatim; the request body shape, Antigravity header
constants, credential-envelope parsing and grounding-metadata handling follow
the pinned revisions below. The MIT notices are reproduced as required.

